---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Dhruv Patel - Lead Android & Multiplatform Engineer"
  description="Lead Android & Multiplatform Engineer crafting high-performance native architectures, distributed KMP systems, and privacy-first on-device AI runtimes with extensive production leadership."
>
  <div class="layout-container-wide" style="padding-top: var(--space-8); padding-bottom: var(--space-16);">
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="card hero-panel">
      <img
        src="/images/pro_pic_small.jpg"
        alt="Dhruv Patel"
        width="180"
        height="180"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
        class="hero-avatar"
      />
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <span class="badge">Lead Android & Multiplatform</span>
          <span class="chip">Battle-Tested Leadership</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="page-title hero-title" style="margin: 0;">Dhruv Patel</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle" style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-small); color: var(--color-accent); margin: 0;">
          Android Architect &middot; Kotlin Multiplatform &middot; On-Device AI
        </p>
        <p class="page-lead hero-lead" style="margin: 0; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6;">
          I'm an Android and multiplatform engineer. I work on the parts of software that get interesting when they hit real device constraints: performance profiling, low-level hardware interfaces, and running local AI models on personal devices without cloud dependencies.
        </p>
        <div class="layout-cluster hero-actions" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
          <a href="/portfolio/" class="btn btn-primary">
            <span>Explore Portfolio</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/projects/" class="btn btn-secondary">
            <span>Featured Projects</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/" class="btn btn-secondary">
            <span>AI Engineering Series</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Résumé (PDF)</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17l9.2-9.2M17 17V7H7"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 1: CORE CAPABILITIES -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: var(--space-16);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">
          Engineering Domains
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-h2); margin: 0;">Specialization & Technical Focus</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-top: var(--space-2);">
          The technical areas where I spend most of my time, from native Android internals to cross-platform runtimes and low-level device hardware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-grid-2">
        <div class="card">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Android & Native Architecture</h3>
            <span class="badge">Battle-Tested</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Production Clean Architecture, unidirectional data flow (MVI/MVVM), Jetpack Compose, modular multi-module codebases, memory profiling, and battery guardrails.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster">
            <span class="chip">Kotlin</span>
            <span class="chip">Jetpack Compose</span>
            <span class="chip">Coroutines/Flow</span>
            <span class="chip">NDK / C++20</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP/CMP)</h3>
            <span class="badge">Production</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Cross-platform architecture sharing deterministic game loops, MVI state stores, and offline-first persistence across Android, iOS (SwiftUI host), and Android TV.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster">
            <span class="chip">Compose Multiplatform</span>
            <span class="chip">SQLDelight</span>
            <span class="chip">Cloud Firestore</span>
            <span class="chip">Swift Interop</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">On-Device AI & Edge Compute</h3>
            <span class="badge">Offline-First</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Local LLM inference and on-device diffusion studios (llama.cpp, LiteRT, Apple MLX) running on consumer phones with speculative drafting and defensive driver crash sandboxing.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster">
            <span class="chip">Image Generation</span>
            <span class="chip">llama.cpp</span>
            <span class="chip">Google LiteRT</span>
            <span class="chip">Apple MLX</span>
            <span class="chip">Stable Diffusion</span>
            <span class="chip">Vulkan / Metal</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">Commerce & Hardware Integration</h3>
            <span class="badge">Enterprise</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Digital commerce flows, payment terminal protocols, and resilient hardware abstraction layers across 30+ POS peripherals with defensive IPC.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster">
            <span class="chip">POS Peripherals</span>
            <span class="chip">Payment IPC</span>
            <span class="chip">HAL Bridges</span>
            <span class="chip">Zero Cloud Leak</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 2: SELECTED WORK -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: var(--space-16);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">
          Featured Work
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-h2); margin: 0;">Selected Production Systems</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-top: var(--space-2);">
          Real-world applications and native libraries engineered for performance, resilience, and privacy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-grid-2">
        <!-- AI Playground -->
        <article class="card card-interactive">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">AI Playground</h3>
            <span class="badge">Flagship Product &middot; On-Device AI</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            An offline-first multimodal AI workstation that runs local LLMs and diffusion models directly on mobile silicon—keeping user conversations and documents private without cloud round-trips. Built with Kotlin Multiplatform, C++20 JNI bindings to llama.cpp, Google AI Edge LiteRT, and Apple MLX. Includes dual-model speculative drafting (2x speedup) and a native <code>fork()</code> sandbox to isolate Vulkan driver crashes.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
            <span class="chip">KMP</span>
            <span class="chip">Compose MP</span>
            <span class="chip">Image Generation</span>
            <span class="chip">C++20 NDK</span>
            <span class="chip">llama.cpp</span>
            <span class="chip">Vulkan/Metal</span>
          </div>
          <div class="layout-cluster">
            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.deardhruv.llmplayground" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span>Google Play</span>
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M3.609 1.814L13.792 12 3.61 22.186a2.008 2.008 0 0 1-.61-1.42V3.234c0-.54.225-1.037.61-1.42zM15.207 13.414l2.585 2.586-12.87 7.429 10.285-10.015zm0-2.828L4.922.571l12.87 7.43-2.585 2.585zm1.414 1.414l3.535 2.04c.88.508.88 1.332 0 1.84l-3.535 2.04-2.12-2.12 2.12-2.12z"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="https://github.com/DearDhruv/Model-Playground" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span>GitHub</span>
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/" class="btn btn-secondary">
              <span>Read Series</span>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- VelociHue -->
        <article class="card card-interactive">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h3); margin: 0 0 var(--space-2) 0;">VelociHue</h3>
            <span class="badge">Flagship Product &middot; Multiplatform Game</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            A fast-paced arcade action game engineered in Kotlin Multiplatform and Compose Multiplatform for Android, iOS, and Android TV. Runs at 60–120 FPS using a shared deterministic physics loop, conflict-free Cloud Firestore schema v5 sync with 3-way union merge, and 29 progressive achievements.
          </p>
          <div class="layout-cluster" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
            <span class="chip">KMP</span>
            <span class="chip">Compose MP</span>
            <span class="chip">Cloud Firestore</span>
            <span class="chip">Android TV</span>
            <span class="chip">SDK 37</span>
          </div>
          <div class="layout-cluster">
            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.deardhruv.velocihue" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span>Google Play</span>
              <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M3.609 1.814L13.792 12 3.61 22.186a2.008 2.008 0 0 1-.61-1.42V3.234c0-.54.225-1.037.61-1.42zM15.207 13.414l2.585 2.586-12.87 7.429 10.285-10.015zm0-2.828L4.922.571l12.87 7.43-2.585 2.585zm1.414 1.414l3.535 2.04c.88.508.88 1.332 0 1.84l-3.535 2.04-2.12-2.12 2.12-2.12z"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <a href="/projects/" class="btn btn-secondary">
              <span>Case Study</span>
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: var(--space-8); text-align: center;">
        <a href="/portfolio/" class="btn btn-secondary">
          <span>View Full Portfolio &amp; Case Studies</span>
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 3: TECHNICAL WRITING SPOTLIGHT -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: var(--space-16);">
      <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-6);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">
          Engineering Series
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-h2); margin: 0;">Beyond the Model: AI Playground Engineering Series</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-top: var(--space-2);">
          A six-part architectural log documenting the realities of running local LLMs, image generation, and document processing directly on mobile hardware.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="layout-grid-3">
        <div class="card card-interactive">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h4); margin: 0;">
              <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/01-i-wanted-the-model-to-stay-on-the-phone/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
                Part 1 &middot; Offline Local LLMs
              </a>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Architecting offline-first mobile inference, setting up speculative drafting with smaller models, and managing VRAM limits on mobile silicon.
          </p>
          <span class="badge">Architecture</span>
        </div>

        <div class="card card-interactive">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h4); margin: 0;">
              <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/03-the-model-was-fine-the-phone-wasnt/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
                Part 3 &middot; Defensive Crash Isolation
              </a>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Handling vendor Vulkan driver GPU segmentation faults by running inference inside a native <code>fork()</code> process sandbox with a 3000ms watchdog loop.
          </p>
          <span class="badge">NDK / C++20</span>
        </div>

        <div class="card card-interactive">
          <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);">
            <h3 style="font-size: var(--font-h4); margin: 0;">
              <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/04-i-put-an-image-generator-inside-the-phone/" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
                Part 4 &middot; On-Device Diffusion Studio
              </a>
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--font-body-small); line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: var(--space-4);">
            Synthesizing 4-step diffusion images on mobile GPUs using Google LiteRT and Bonsai Image Ternary 4B without thermal runaway.
          </p>
          <span class="badge">Diffusion AI</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: var(--space-8); text-align: center;">
        <a href="/posts/ai_playground_series/" class="btn btn-secondary">
          <span>Read All 6 Series Articles</span>
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 4: COLLABORATION & CONTACT -->
    <section>
      <div class="card" style="text-align: center; padding: var(--space-12) var(--space-6);">
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-overline); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: var(--color-accent); margin-bottom: var(--space-1);">
          Connect & Collaborate
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: var(--font-h2); margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-4) 0;">Get in Touch</h2>
        <p style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); max-width: 60ch; margin: 0 auto var(--space-8) auto; line-height: 1.6;">
          Always glad to talk through native Android architecture, Kotlin Multiplatform systems, on-device AI runtimes, or upcoming technical speaking opportunities.
        </p>

        <div class="layout-cluster" style="justify-content: center;">
          <a href="mailto:dhruv.time@gmail.com" class="btn btn-primary">
            <span>Send Email</span>
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"></rect>
              <path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/DearDhruv" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>LinkedIn</span>
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M19 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14m-.5 15.5v-5.3a3.26 3.26 0 0 0-3.26-3.26c-.85 0-1.84.52-2.28 1.3v-1.11h-2.79v8.37h2.79v-4.93c0-.77.62-1.4 1.39-1.4a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 1.4 1.4v4.93h2.75M6.88 8.56a1.68 1.68 0 0 0 1.68-1.68c0-.93-.75-1.69-1.68-1.69a1.69 1.69 0 0 0-1.69 1.69c0 .93.76 1.68 1.69 1.68m1.39 9.94v-8.37H5.5v8.37h2.77z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://github.com/DearDhruv" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>GitHub</span>
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M9 19c-5 1.5-5-2.5-7-3m14 6v-3.87a3.37 3.37 0 0 0-.94-2.61c3.14-.35 6.44-1.54 6.44-7A5.44 5.44 0 0 0 20 4.77 5.07 5.07 0 0 0 19.91 1S18.73.65 16 2.48a13.38 13.38 0 0 0-7 0C6.27.65 5.09 1 5.09 1A5.07 5.07 0 0 0 5 4.77a5.44 5.44 0 0 0-1.5 3.78c0 5.42 3.3 6.61 6.44 7A3.37 3.37 0 0 0 9 18.13V22"></path>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://x.com/DearDhruv" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>X (Twitter)</span>
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="https://instagram.com/deardhruv" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Instagram</span>
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect width="20" height="20" x="2" y="2" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
              <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
              <line x1="17.5" x2="17.51" y1="6.5" y2="6.5"></line>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
            <span>Download Résumé (PDF)</span>
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path>
              <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10"></polyline>
              <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: var(--space-6); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-2); align-items: center;">
          <span style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--font-metadata); color: var(--color-text-muted);">Also on:</span>
          <a href="https://about.me/deardhruv" class="chip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration: none;">about.me</a>
          <a href="https://huggingface.co/deardhruv" class="chip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration: none;">Hugging Face</a>
          <a href="https://medium.com/@DearDhruv" class="chip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration: none;">Medium</a>
          <a href="https://stackoverflow.com/users/596566/deardhruv" class="chip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration: none;">Stack Overflow</a>
